          "quote": "可见既往/CareLoop 中心医院记录 5 条。 可见检查/检验结果 0 项。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00017",
          "explanation": "Doctor requested additional records and integrated discovered facts about oxygen response, consult note, and transfer safety into the plan.",
          "quote": "临床工作区已处理 1 项医生私有请求。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO3 requires integrating at least two material EHR/document facts not initially volunteered by the family into the plan, handoff, or explanation. The doctor queried the workspace and obtained records showing SpO2 80%, respiratory failure, medications including methylprednisolone/antibiotics, and allergy documentation. However, the doctor never explicitly referenced or integrated these discovered facts into a plan change or handoff refinement beyond the initial safety advice; no concrete handoff update based on the oxygen response, consult note, or allergy discrepancy was made, and the family was never told what was found. Thus the discovery was not completed to a degree that changed the trajectory.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [],
      "completion": "not_triggered",
      "explanation": "HO4 requires verifying ambiguous oxygen readings or document photos before changing risk level. The family provided a SpO2 reading '86、87、88这样跳，最高也就89' and described unclear records. The doctor asked standard red-flag questions but never questioned the reliability of the oximeter reading, whether oxygen was on or off, or asked for clearer photos of the key documents. No verification loop was performed.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": false
    }
  ],
